        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Fetch MiniMax Token Plan recharge credit balance",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- MiniMax Coding Plan / Token Plan **remains APIs do not expose the console recharge-credit balance** (积分余额). CodexBar now fetches it from the web console endpoint `GET /backend/account/token_plan_credit` on `www.minimaxi.com` / `www.minimax.io` when a browser session cookie is available.\n- Web-session refreshes always attempt the credit fetch after quota/billing enrichment (even when billing history is disabled).\n- API-token refreshes merge recharge credits only when an **explicit** manual or environment cookie is configured (not cached browser cookies), using the **resolved API region** after global→China retry and preserving curl `x-group-id` overrides.\n- Credit enrichment is best-effort for auth/transport/parser failures but **propagates cancellation** like the other MiniMax optional enrichments.\n- `MINIMAX_HOST` no longer rewrites the credit endpoint to `platform.*`; use `MINIMAX_TOKEN_PLAN_CREDIT_URL` for proxies.\n- Diagnostics export includes `pointsBalance`; menu rendering reuses the existing `MiniMax points balance` cost row.\n\n## Review follow-up (972cffac)\n\n- [x] Propagate `CancellationError` / `URLError.cancelled` from `attachingTokenPlanCreditIfAvailable`\n- [x] Fix duplicate `0.37.3` changelog heading drift\n- [x] Preserve `MiniMaxCookieOverride.groupID` from curl/manual cookies on the API enrichment path\n- [x] Stop auto-merging cached browser cookies into API-key refreshes\n- [x] Use `fetchAPITokenUsage(...).resolvedRegion` for credit host selection after global→China retry\n- [x] Keep credit fetches on `www.*` under `MINIMAX_HOST` overrides\n\n## Motivation\n\nUsers with recharge credits (e.g. 20,000 points in the MiniMax console) saw quota data via API key but `providerCostPresent: false` in diagnostics and no balance in the menu. The balance lives on a separate cookie-authenticated endpoint discovered from the platform web bundle.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `swift test --filter MiniMaxTokenPlanCreditTests` (10 tests)\n- [x] `make check`\n- [x] Parser coverage for `remaining_credits`, `balance_breakdown.total_balance`, and `total_credits - used_credits`\n- [x] Web + API enrichment paths via `ProviderHTTPTransportStub`\n- [x] Cancellation propagation, curl group-id forwarding, resolved China region, host-override behavior\n\n## Behavior proof\n\n**API-only account (no explicit cookie):** built PR CLI on this branch\n\n```bash\n.build/debug/CodexBarCLI diagnose --provider minimax --format json --pretty\n```\n\n→ `source: api`, quota present, `pointsBalance` omitted (expected; cookie required).\n\n**Cookie + session (expected after explicit cookie config):** redacted diagnose shape when `token_plan_credit` succeeds:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n  \"source\": \"api\",\n  \"providerCostPresent\": true,\n  \"details\": {\n    \"planName\": \"Max\",\n    \"pointsBalance\": 20000\n  }\n}\n```\n\nLive console endpoint response shape used in fixtures/tests (`remaining_credits: 20000`, `base_resp.status_code: 0`). Contributor account currently has API key only; attaching a redacted menu/diagnose screenshot after configuring MiniMax manual cookie or `MINIMAX_COOKIE` is the remaining live proof step.\n\n## Notes for reviewers\n\n- Bearer API key alone still cannot read `token_plan_credit` (console returns `not login`); cookie is required for the balance.\n- Optional override: `MINIMAX_TOKEN_PLAN_CREDIT_URL`\n- Docs: `docs/minimax.md`",
        "branch": "feat/minimax-token-plan-credit",
